OL,3,ACOP31 climate talks in jeopardy as EU
OL,4,Aformally rejects latest draft after
OL,5,Afossil fuels row
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe EU and some countries had been
OL,8,Fpushing to restore a commitment to move
OL,9,Faway from fossil fuels after producers
OL,10,Fled by Saudi Arabia called for its
OL,11,Fremoval - the fourth draft still
OL,12,Fcontains no mention of fossil fuels
OL,14,FThe issue of finance to help developing
OL,15,Fnations adapt to climate change also
OL,16,Fremains unresolved at the summit in
OL,17,FAntalya
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
